              <li><strong>Chest:</strong> Measure across the fullest part of your chest, keeping tape horizontal under arms.</li>
              <li><strong>Waist:</strong> Measure across the narrowest part of the shirt waistline.</li>
              <li><strong>Length:</strong> Measure from the highest point of the collar down to the bottom hem.</li>
